---
// Newsletter — compact centred signup with inline email field and button.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-card border border-line bg-surface px-6 py-12 text-center sm:px-12 sm:py-14">
      <span class="mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 dark:bg-brand-950/40 dark:text-brand-300">
        <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M21 3L10 14"></path>
          <path d="M21 3l-7 18-4-7-7-4z"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">The Calm Dispatch</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">One thoughtful email a month on planning well, working less frantically and running a team people enjoy being on.</p>

      <form action="#" method="post" class="mx-auto mt-8 flex max-w-md flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <label for="newsletter-email" class="sr-only">Email address</label>
        <input id="newsletter-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" class="block w-full min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-button border border-line bg-bg px-5 py-3 text-fg placeholder:text-muted/70 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500" />
        <button type="submit" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-brand-600 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-brand-700 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted">Read by 18,000 team leads. No tracking pixels, and you can unsubscribe in one click.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
